Privacy Policy for YouTube Hide Controls (YTHC)
Effective Date: October 2026

Overview
YouTube Hide Controls . is committed to protecting user privacy. This Privacy Policy outlines our data handling practices for the YouTube Hide Controls Chrome Extension.

1. Information Collection and Usage
YouTube Hide Controls does not collect, store, track, transmit, or sell any personal data, identifiable user information, browsing history, or user activity. The extension operates 100% locally within your web browser.

2. Local Data Storage
The extension uses Chrome’s local storage API (chrome.storage.local) strictly to save your UI preferences (such as whether control hiding is currently enabled or disabled). This data:

Is stored exclusively on your local device.
Is never uploaded to external servers, cloud storage, or third-party services.
Is automatically deleted if you uninstall the extension.

